    "text": "<div style=\"font-size: 10.5px; color: #8a8fa3; text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;\">When its bar is full, a unit uses its skill.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,215,106,0.45);background:rgba(255,215,106,0.07);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"flex:none;overflow:visible;\"><path d=\"M5 19 L12 12 L19 19 M5 12 L12 5 L19 12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffd76a\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#ffd76a;\">Growth</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.14em;color:#ffd76a;border:1px solid rgba(255,215,106,0.55);border-radius:4px;padding:1px 5px;\">GIFT</span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#e8e8ee;margin-top:4px;\">Grows a stage every 4 fights it wins: Baby, Young, Adult, Elder. Each stage is bigger, tougher and hits harder.</div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;border:1px solid rgba(185,140,255,0.45);background:rgba(185,140,255,0.07);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"flex:none;overflow:visible;\"><path d=\"M3 12 L20 4.5 V19.5 Z\" fill=\"#b98cff33\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b98cff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M9 12 H15\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b98cff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#b98cff;\">Breath</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.14em;color:#b98cff;border:1px solid rgba(185,140,255,0.55);border-radius:4px;padding:1px 5px;\">SKILL</span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#e8e8ee;margin-top:4px;\">A Baby hits one enemy. From Adult on, the breath hits every enemy. If the Dragon falls, all its growth is lost.</div></div>"
