    "text": "<div style=\"font-size: 10.5px; color: #8a8fa3; text-align: center; margin-top: 8px;\">When its bar is full, a unit uses its skill.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;border:1px solid rgba(255,215,106,0.45);background:rgba(255,215,106,0.07);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"flex:none;overflow:visible;\"><path d=\"M12 3.5 C7.6 3.5 4.8 6.4 4.8 10.2 C4.8 12.5 5.8 14 7.2 14.8 V19.5 H16.8 V14.8 C18.2 14 19.2 12.5 19.2 10.2 C19.2 6.4 16.4 3.5 12 3.5 Z\" fill=\"#ffd76a33\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffd76a\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"10.6\" r=\"1.7\" fill=\"#ffd76a\"/><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"10.6\" r=\"1.7\" fill=\"#ffd76a\"/><path d=\"M10 19.5 V17 M12 19.5 V17 M14 19.5 V17\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffd76a\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#ffd76a;\">Raise</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.14em;color:#ffd76a;border:1px solid rgba(255,215,106,0.55);border-radius:4px;padding:1px 5px;\">GIFT</span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#e8e8ee;margin-top:4px;\">Anyone who dies, yours or theirs, rises as a skeleton on your side until the fight ends. At most 4 at once.</div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;border:1px solid rgba(185,140,255,0.45);background:rgba(185,140,255,0.07);border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" style=\"flex:none;overflow:visible;\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"15\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#b98cff33\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b98cff\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"15\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#b98cff33\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b98cff\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#b98cff33\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b98cff\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><path d=\"M4 21 H20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#b98cff\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#b98cff;\">Horde</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.14em;color:#b98cff;border:1px solid rgba(185,140,255,0.55);border-radius:4px;padding:1px 5px;\">SKILL</span></div><div style=\"font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.45;color:#e8e8ee;margin-top:4px;\">Every skeleton strikes the front enemy for 8 at once. Each time it goes again, the whole army swings again.</div></div>"
